{
  "book": "Psa", "book_id": 19, "chapter": 38, "provenance": "reread-psalms-2026",
  "note": "Ps38 penitential (corrected method). Human IB: sin (chattath/avon/ivveleth) + anguish (lev tumult/throb, ta'avah, anachah, makob) + silent forbearance (deaf/mute) + yachal wait + confession (nagad/da'ag) + foes' malice. 5 God-acts (qetseph/chemah/za'am wrath; azab-not/teshuah) = QUALIFIERS source-linked. Every candidate roled. Poetic ledger; span-id pairs; roles read-2026.",
  "spans": {
    "277964": {"gloss":"health v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"health / soundness / wholeness (shalom - lost)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277964,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"lost because of God's indignation (v3)","from":277964,"to":277962,"res":"span"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"absent ('there is NO health in my bones')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'there is no HEALTH (shalom) in my bones because of my sin' — the loss of whole-person soundness under sin; shalom here the wellness/wholeness destroyed by God's indignation (v3 qualifier) and David's own sin, the total un-peace of the guilty sufferer"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277968": {"gloss":"sin v3","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sin (chattath)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277968,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the cause of the lost health","from":277968,"to":277964,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'no health in my bones because of my SIN (chattath)' — sin as the root of the bodily/inner ruin; chattath (recurs v18) the missing-of-the-mark whose consequence is the sufferer's lost soundness"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277969": {"gloss":"iniquities v4","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquities (avon)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277969,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"gone over his head","to":277969,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"a heavy burden","from":277969,"to":277974,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my INIQUITIES (avon) have gone over my head; like a heavy burden, too heavy for me' — guilt as an engulfing flood and crushing load; avon (recurs v18) the iniquity that overwhelms and weighs the sufferer beyond bearing"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277982": {"gloss":"foolishness v5","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"foolishness / folly (ivveleth)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277982,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My wounds stink and fester because of my FOOLISHNESS (ivveleth)' — folly named as the cause of the festering wounds; ivveleth the moral stupidity whose fruit is the sufferer's rotting hurt, sin owned as folly"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277989": {"gloss":"mourning v6","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"mourn / go about darkly (qadar)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277989,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"mourn"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"all the day, bowed down","to":277989,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'utterly bowed down... all the day I go about MOURNING (qadar)' — ceaseless darkened grief; qadar (recurs Ps35:14) the mourning-blackness that bends the sufferer low all day long"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278003": {"gloss":"heart v8","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - tumult of my heart)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":278003,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278003,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"its tumult makes him groan","from":278003,"to":278001,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I groan because of the TUMULT of my HEART (lev)' — the roaring disquiet of the inmost seat; lev here the heart in turmoil (first of two, v8 tumult / v10 throbs) whose agitation forces groaning"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278006": {"gloss":"longing v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"longing / desire (ta'avah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278006,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"before the LORD","to":278006,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with sighing","from":278006,"to":278009,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'all my LONGING (ta'avah) is before you' — the whole desire of the sufferer laid open to God; ta'avah (recurs Ps21:2) here the deep craving for relief, wholly exposed before the LORD"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "278009": {"gloss":"sighing v9","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sighing / groaning (anachah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":278009,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"not hidden from God","from":278009,"to":278011,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my SIGHING (anachah) is not hidden from you' — the groan God fully sees; anachah (recurs Ps31:10) the sigh of grief, transparent before the LORD who misses nothing of the sufferer's inner state"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277872": {"gloss":"heart v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heart (lev - throbs)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"heart (self)","to":277872,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277872,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"throb / palpitate","to":277872,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with failing strength","from":277872,"to":277875,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My HEART (lev) throbs; my strength fails me' — the palpitating, panting heart of exhaustion; lev here (second, cf v8) the seat in violent agitation, its throbbing draining the sufferer's strength and the light of his eyes"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277875": {"gloss":"fails v10","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"forsake / fail (azab - strength fails)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David's strength","to":277875,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"forsake / fail"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277875,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with the throbbing heart","from":277875,"to":277872,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'my strength FAILS (azab) me' — vitality itself abandoning him; azab here of strength forsaking David (the same verb he begs God not to do, v21) — his own powers desert him as the light of his eyes goes out"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277883": {"gloss":"friends v11","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"friends / those who love me (aheb)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David's friends (now aloof)","to":277883,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"stand aloof","to":277883,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277883,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:person"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'My FRIENDS (aheb - those who love me) and companions stand aloof from my plague' — the abandonment by the very ones who loved him; aheb here names the lovers/friends who now withdraw, the loneliness of the afflicted deserted even by kin"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277891": {"gloss":"seek-life v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"seek / hunt (baqash - seek my life)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes","to":277891,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"seek / hunt"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"my life","from":277891,"to":277892,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"laying snares","to":277891,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Those who SEEK (baqash) my life lay their snares' — the foes' murderous hunt; baqash the pursuit of David's life, snares set while friends stand aloof (parallel to darash v12b)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277892": {"gloss":"life v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"life / soul (nefesh)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"soul (self)","to":277892,"res":"span"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277892,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"sought by the foes","from":277892,"to":277891,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:seat"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'those who seek my LIFE (nefesh)' — the life the foes hunt; nefesh here the life-self targeted by the snare-layers, the sufferer beset within (by guilt) and without (by enemies)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277894": {"gloss":"seek-hurt v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"seek (darash - seek my hurt)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes","to":277894,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"seek"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"my hurt","from":277894,"to":277895,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'those who SEEK (darash) my hurt speak of ruin' — the foes' pursuit of harm; darash (usually seek God, Ps34:4; here inverted) the searching-out of David's injury, joined to ruinous speech and treachery"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277895": {"gloss":"hurt v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hurt / harm (ra'ah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes (seeking it for David)","to":277895,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277895,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the thing sought","from":277895,"to":277894,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'those who seek my HURT (ra'ah)' — the harm the foes pursue; ra'ah the injury/calamity they intend, the object of their malicious searching"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277897": {"gloss":"ruin v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"ruin / destruction (havvah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes (their speech)","to":277897,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"speak","to":277897,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with meditating treachery","from":277897,"to":277898,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'they speak of RUIN (havvah)' — destructive words from the foes; havvah = engulfing ruin/calamity, the destruction their mouths pronounce against David"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277898": {"gloss":"meditate v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"meditate / mutter (hagah - treachery)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes","to":277898,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"meditate / plot"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"treachery","from":277898,"to":277899,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"all day long","to":277898,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with ruinous speech","from":277898,"to":277897,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'and MEDITATE (hagah) treachery all day long' — the foes' relentless inner plotting; hagah (the same word for meditating God's law, Ps1:2, and the righteous's wisdom, Ps37:30) here darkly inverted — the mind muttering deceit all day"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277899": {"gloss":"treachery v12","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"treachery / deceit (mirmah)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes","to":277899,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the thing meditated","from":277899,"to":277898,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'meditate TREACHERY (mirmah)' — the deceit their plotting devises; mirmah (recurs Ps35:20) the guile the foes' minds work up against the afflicted"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277905": {"gloss":"hear/deaf v13","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hear (shama - like a deaf man, negated = silent forbearance)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277905,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hear (deliberately not)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the foes' words","to":277905,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"like a deaf/mute man","to":277905,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"continued as no rebukes in his mouth","from":277905,"to":277915,"res":"span"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"deliberate ('I do NOT hear, like a deaf man')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'But I am like a deaf man; I do not HEAR (shama), like a mute who does not open his mouth' — chosen silence before the foes; the deliberate deafness/muteness = patient forbearance, refusing to retaliate, leaving vindication to God (v15)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277919": {"gloss":"wait v15","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wait / hope (yachal)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277919,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"wait / hope"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"the LORD","to":277919,"res":"inferred"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"grounded by God's answering/salvation (v22)","from":277919,"to":306287,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'But for you, O LORD, do I WAIT (yachal); it is you who will answer' — the turn from silence to hope; yachal (recurs Ps33:18) the waiting-hope that is the sufferer's answer to the foes' malice — not retaliation but expectation of God"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277924": {"gloss":"rejoice v16","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"rejoice (samach - let them not rejoice)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes (denied joy)","to":277924,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"rejoice (deprecated)"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"over David","to":277924,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"boasting against him","from":277924,"to":277925,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":113,"l":"prohibition","k":"flag","v":"deprecated ('let them NOT rejoice over me')"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'let them not REJOICE (samach) over me, who boast when my foot slips' — the foes' gloating David prays against; samach (recurs Ps35:19) the malicious joy that would triumph at his fall"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277931": {"gloss":"pain v17","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"pain / sorrow (makob)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277931,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"ever before him","to":277931,"res":"inferred"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I am ready to fall, and my PAIN (makob) is ever before me' — unrelenting suffering held constantly in view; makob the pain/sorrow that never leaves the sufferer's sight, driving him to confession (v18)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277935": {"gloss":"confess v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"declare / confess (nagad)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277935,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"confess"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"my iniquity","from":277935,"to":277936,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with sorrow for sin","from":277935,"to":277937,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"external:god"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I CONFESS (nagad) my iniquity; I am sorry for my sin' — the open declaration of guilt; nagad = to make known/declare, the sufferer laying his iniquity before God, the penitential turn matching Ps32:5"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277936": {"gloss":"iniquity v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"iniquity (avon)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277936,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the thing confessed","from":277936,"to":277935,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I confess my INIQUITY (avon)' — the guilt now owned before God; avon (recurs v4, where it overwhelmed him) here brought to open confession, the flood-burden acknowledged"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277937": {"gloss":"sorry v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be anxious / sorry / grieve (da'ag)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277937,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"be sorry / anxious"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"because of my sin","from":277937,"to":277939,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"paired with confession","from":277937,"to":277935,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I am SORRY (da'ag) for my sin' — the anxious grief of contrition; da'ag = to be anxious/troubled, the inner sorrow over sin that accompanies confession, godly remorse"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277939": {"gloss":"sin v18","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"sin (chattath)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277939,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the object of sorrow","from":277939,"to":277937,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'I am sorry for my SIN (chattath)' — the sin grieved over; chattath (recurs v3) here the object of contrition, the sin whose consequences ravaged him now mourned in penitence"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277944": {"gloss":"hate v19","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hate (sane - wrongfully)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"action"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes","to":277944,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"hate"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277944,"res":"inferred"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"wrongfully / falsely","from":277944,"to":277945,"res":"span"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'many are those who HATE (sane) me wrongfully' — causeless hatred from the vigorous foes; sane (recurs Ps35:19) the groundless enmity, hatred without just cause multiplying against the afflicted"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277951": {"gloss":"evil v20","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"evil (ra'ah - render evil for good)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"the foes","to":277951,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"render","from":277951,"to":277950,"res":"span"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"David (in place of his good)","from":277951,"to":277953,"res":"span"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"repaid for his good","from":277951,"to":277953,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'Those who render me EVIL (ra'ah) for good accuse me' — the foes' ingratitude; ra'ah (recurs Ps35:12) the evil returned for David's good, injustice heaped on the penitent sufferer"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277953": {"gloss":"good(repaid) v20","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"good (tovah - repaid with evil)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David (his good to them)","to":277953,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"repaid with evil","from":277953,"to":277951,"res":"span"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'render me evil for GOOD (tovah)' — the good David did, returned as evil; tovah the kindness betrayed, the same injustice as Ps35:12"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277957": {"gloss":"good(followed) v20","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"good (tov - I follow after good)"},{"n":102,"l":"type","k":"value","v":"status"},{"n":104,"l":"seat","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":105,"l":"bearer","k":"pair","v":"David","to":277957,"res":"inferred"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"event","v":"follow after","to":277957,"res":"inferred"},{"n":107,"l":"target","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"none","res":"none"},{"n":116,"l":"locus","k":"value","v":"internal:ib-state"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"'they accuse me because I follow after GOOD (tov)' — David's pursuit of good, the very reason for their hostility; tov here the good David chases, his integrity provoking the foes' enmity"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"characteristic"}]},
    "277868": {"gloss":"anger v1 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"anger (qetseph - God's, rebuke)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the wrath David's suffering flows from (v1->v3)","from":277868,"to":277964,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1 QUALIFIER (God's anger): 'O LORD, rebuke me not in your ANGER (qetseph)' — God's anger is not a human IB char; it is the SOURCE David dreads and suffers under, grounding his lost health (v3) — captured as a qualifier of shalom-loss (v3)."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277871": {"gloss":"wrath v1 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"wrath / heat (chemah - God's)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"the wrath David's suffering flows from (v1->v3)","from":277871,"to":277964,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1 QUALIFIER (God's wrath): 'nor discipline me in your WRATH (chemah)' — God's hot wrath is not a human IB char; it is the SOURCE of David's chastening suffering — captured as a qualifier of shalom-loss (v3)."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277962": {"gloss":"indignation v3 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"indignation (za'am - God's)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"cause of David's lost health (v3)","from":277962,"to":277964,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v3 QUALIFIER (God's indignation): 'no soundness in my flesh because of your INDIGNATION (za'am)' — God's indignation is not a human IB char; it is the SOURCE of David's un-health — captured as a qualifier of shalom-loss (v3)."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "306278": {"gloss":"forsake v21 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"forsake (azab - God's, negated plea)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"grounds David's waiting-hope (v15,21)","from":306278,"to":277919,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v21 QUALIFIER (God's act, negated): 'Do not FORSAKE (azab) me, O LORD! be not far from me!' — God's not-forsaking is not a human IB char; it is the SOURCE grounding David's waiting-hope (v15) — captured as a qualifier of yachal (v15). (Note: azab-of-strength v10 IS a human-condition char; this v21 azab is God's.)"},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "306287": {"gloss":"salvation v22 [GOD-QUALIFIER]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"salvation (teshuah - God's)"},{"n":103,"l":"source","k":"pair","v":"grounds David's waiting-hope (v15)","from":306287,"to":277919,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v22 QUALIFIER (God's provision): 'Make haste to help me, O LORD, my SALVATION (teshuah)!' — salvation as God's is not a human IB char; it is the SOURCE David waits for and appeals to — captured as a qualifier of yachal (v15)."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277865": {"gloss":"memorial v1 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"bring to remembrance (zakar - 'for the memorial offering')"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v1 superscription: 'for the MEMORIAL offering (zakar / lehazkir)' - a liturgical designation of the psalm (the azkarah/memorial portion), not a human IB operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "277974": {"gloss":"heavy v4 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"heavy / weigh down (kabed - like a heavy burden)"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"qualifies the iniquities' crushing weight","from":277974,"to":277969,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v4: 'like a HEAVY (kabed) burden, they are too heavy for me' - the felt weight of the iniquities (277969); qualifies the guilt's crushing heaviness. Qualifier of iniquities."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278011": {"gloss":"hidden v9 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hide (sathar - sighing not hidden, negated)"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"qualifies the sighing as not-hidden from God","from":278011,"to":278009,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v9: 'my sighing is not HIDDEN (sathar) from you' - the not-hiddenness of David's groaning; qualifies the sighing (278009) as fully open before God. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "278001": {"gloss":"tumult v8 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"tumult / roaring / disquiet (nehamah)"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"the disquiet of the heart (278003)","from":278001,"to":278003,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v8: 'I groan because of the TUMULT (nehamah) of my heart' - the roaring disquiet of the heart (278003); qualifies the heart's agitation. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277915": {"gloss":"hear/mute v14 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"hear (shama - like a man who does not hear)"},{"n":112,"l":"coupling","k":"pair","v":"continues the silent forbearance (277905)","from":277915,"to":277905,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v14: 'like a man who does not HEAR (shama), no rebukes in his mouth' - continues v13's chosen deafness/muteness; qualifies the silent forbearance (277905). Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277925": {"gloss":"boast v16 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"magnify oneself / boast (gadal)"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"the manner of the foes' would-be rejoicing (277924)","from":277925,"to":277924,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v16: 'who BOAST (gadal) against me when my foot slips' - the self-magnifying that accompanies the foes' gloating; qualifies rejoice (277924). Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277945": {"gloss":"wrongfully v19 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"falsehood / wrongfully (sheqer)"},{"n":108,"l":"manner","k":"pair","v":"qualifies the hatred as causeless/false","from":277945,"to":277944,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v19: those who hate me 'WRONGFULLY (sheqer)' - the falseness/causelessness qualifying the hatred (277944); no just ground. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277950": {"gloss":"render v20 [qualifier]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"repay / render (shalam)"},{"n":106,"l":"operation","k":"pair","v":"the repaying by which evil is given for good (277951)","from":277950,"to":277951,"res":"span"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v20: 'those who RENDER (shalam) me evil for good' - the act of repayment by which the foes give evil (277951) for David's good; qualifies the evil-for-good. Qualifier."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"qualifier"}]},
    "277960": {"gloss":"flesh v3 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"flesh (basar - no soundness in my flesh)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v3: 'no soundness in my FLESH (basar)' - the body/flesh as the site of the suffering; physical, not an inner operation (the IB finding is the lost shalom, 277964). Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "277996": {"gloss":"flesh v7 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"flesh (basar - no soundness in my flesh)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v7: 'no soundness in my FLESH (basar)' (repeated from v3) - the burning-filled body; physical site of suffering, not an inner operation. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]},
    "277985": {"gloss":"down v6 [standalone]","dims":[{"n":101,"l":"sense","k":"value","v":"be bowed down / bent (shachah / avah)"},{"n":114,"l":"discovery","k":"note","v":"v6: 'I am utterly BOWED DOWN and prostrate' - the physical posture of grief accompanying the mourning (277989); a bodily bearing, captured as standalone alongside the mourning char. Standalone."},{"n":115,"l":"role","k":"value","v":"standalone"}]}
  }
